{
 "system": "Forge Temper",
 "island": "Hephaestus",
 "rule": "Every brew is tempered by quench path. Craft a tonic at the mortar (or hand-mix), then quench it: magma | spring | dual. Magma temper: strength x2, duration x0.5. Spring quench: duration x2, strength x0.5. Dual-quench (magma then spring, or spring then magma within 10s): dual effect \u2014 both the primary pair effect and the next-best matching pair land at base strength/duration. Quench uses Prop_ForgeQuenchTub_Basalt (magma side) or HotSpring_Clean / QuenchTrough_Forge cooled fill (spring side). Livestock grit (slag-grass) fertilises herb beds +10% growth.",
